# VM (GCP / lab) — SSH, VNC, agents

Runbook: `docs/LLM_MESH_BRIDGE.md` · `docs/STUDEX_FLEET_MESH.md`

## Access (no public VNC)

- [ ] Tailscale on VM; MagicDNS name in `LAB_HOST_*`
- [ ] Prefer `tailscale ssh user@dark-factory` over open port 22
- [ ] VNC only on tailnet or IAP tunnel — never 0.0.0.0:5900 on public IP
- [ ] GCP: OS Login or serial console for break-glass

## LLM + agents on VM

- [ ] `ollama` (optional) + `omniroute` on VM
- [ ] `herdr` + `hermes gateway`; `tailscale serve --bg 8642`
- [ ] Obsidian checklist lives on **operator Mac**; socket forward if driving from Mac:

```bash
ssh -N -L /tmp/herdr-vm.sock:/home/you/.config/herdr/herdr.sock dark-factory
```

- [ ] Plugin socket path → `/tmp/herdr-vm.sock`

## Verify

- [ ] `./scripts/llm-mesh-preflight.sh` on VM
- [ ] `./scripts/studex-fleet-connect.sh --soft-fail` from hub